        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-C6, River Rock Collection Oval Mount Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Oval Mount Towel Bar is available in 3 sizes: 18 inch, 20 inch, and a 30 inch. All are easy to install and come packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. Choose from either medium bronze or a dark bronze finish. This bronze oval rose towel bar is a great choice for traditional homes that favor rich, earth-tones enhanced by simple yet beautiful design.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/river-rock-bronze-oval-towel-ring-fusion-tr-c6\"><b>Fusion TR-C6 River Rock Towel Ring</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/river-rock-bronze-oval-robe-hook-fusion-rh-c6\"><b>Fusion RH-C6 River Rock Robe Hook</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/oval-mount-toilet-tissue-holder-fusion-ph-c6\"><b>Fusion PH-C6 River Rock Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-C6</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-C6</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-C6</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
